# Build context = repo root for both backend images (apps/wc-api/Dockerfile + worker/Dockerfile).
# The images only need apps/wc-api/ source — trim everything else so the context stays small and no
# build output / secret / unrelated tree is sent to the daemon. (Keeps apps/wc-api/gradle/wrapper/.)
**/build/
**/.gradle/
.git/
.github/
**/node_modules/
apps/wc-web/
apps/wc-e2e/
infra/
docs/
*.md
**/*.iml
.idea/
.vscode/
